Package: solvephrust
Title: Fast Generic Water Chemistry pH Solver
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Sierra", "Johnson", , "sjohnson2@brwncald.com", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Carter", role = "ctb"),
    person("Authors of the dependency Rust crates", role = "cph",
           comment = "see inst/AUTHORS file")
  )
Description: Configurable water chemistry equilibrium pH calculations backed
    by a fast 'Rust' implementation. Compound dissociation constants, reaction
    enthalpies, and charges are supplied through the R API. Default constants
    follow Benjamin (2015, ISBN:9781478623083).
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/sierrajohnson/solvephrust
BugReports: https://github.com/sierrajohnson/solvephrust/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Config/rextendr/version: 0.4.2
SystemRequirements: Cargo (Rust's package manager), rustc >= 1.65.0, xz
Depends: 
    R (>= 4.2)
Suggests: 
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
